{"id":"n62331-3-9","stage":0,"title":"거 · 表示某人的所有物。","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62331-3-9-1","ko":"와, 컴퓨터 새로 샀니? 멋있다.","zh":"哇，你买了新电脑啊？真厉害。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"와,","meaning":"啊，咦","explanation":"와：啊，咦","readings":[{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17872","senseId":"1","lemma":"와","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}},{"text":"컴퓨터","meaning":"电脑","explanation":"컴퓨터：电脑","readings":[{"term":"컴퓨터","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72167","senseId":"1","lemma":"컴퓨터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"컴퓨터","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3"}},{"text":"새로","meaning":"新","explanation":"새로：新","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"1","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}},{"text":"샀니?","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"샀니","audio":"/audio/8ca533770ae038703bee.mp3"}},{"text":"멋있다.","meaning":"帅气，优秀","explanation":"멋있다：帅气，优秀；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"멋있다","audio":"/audio/79ca95990baff4c41958.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15989","senseId":"1","lemma":"멋있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멋있다","audio":"/audio/79ca95990baff4c41958.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d536e6255a4151ea","term":"와","zh":"啊，咦","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3","entryId":"17872","definition":"遇到惊喜时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["와"]},{"id":"cff8b01657dff709","term":"컴퓨터","zh":"电脑","audio":